sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Room
  participant Worker
  participant Firebase
  App->>Room: TX: persist SessionSummary + UPLOAD_SESSION_SUMMARY
  Room-->>App: committed
  Worker->>Room: read FIFO ready operation
  Worker->>Firebase: owner-scoped idempotent write
  Firebase-->>Worker: ACK
  Worker->>Room: mark/remove delivered operation
  Note over Room,Firebase: Offline/failure leaves operation pending for retry
